## 6. Category filter pills — single row
If the pills are wrapping to two rows, force a horizontal scroll instead so the layout stays tight.

```css
.filters-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;        /* prevent wrapping */
  overflow-x: auto;         /* horizontal scroll if needed */
  gap: 8px;
  padding-bottom: 4px;      /* space for scrollbar if visible */
  scrollbar-width: none;    /* hide scrollbar on Firefox */
}
.filters-row::-webkit-scrollbar {
  display: none;            /* hide scrollbar on Chrome */
}
```

